<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2039120680"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1680653176"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="ソラゴト"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="明透"/><amll:meta key="album" value="ASU"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:23.434"><div begin="00:08.075" end="03:20.404"><p begin="00:08.075" end="00:10.896" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">そう言えば そうこの胸の穴<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">话说回来 不曾留意过</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u i e ba so u ko no mu ne no a na</span></p><p begin="00:11.511" end="00:14.613" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">気にも留めないでいたよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">内心的空洞呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ni mo to me na i de i ta yo</span></p><p begin="00:14.973" end="00:18.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">どんな具合に見えてるの？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知它现在怎样了呢？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na gu a i ni mi e te ru no ？</span></p><p begin="00:18.219" end="00:21.593" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">今更だけどね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽说 也已事已至此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma sa ra da ke do ne</span></p><p begin="00:22.501" end="00:25.389" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">約束じゃない想定内で辛い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不曾有过约定 一切都如预想般痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya ku so ku ja na i so u te i na i de tsu ra i</span></p><p begin="00:25.786" end="00:28.410" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">続きはまた持ち越しだろうって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再继续下去 不过只是敷衍拖延</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu zu ki ha ma ta mo chi ko shi da ro u</span></p><p begin="00:28.683" end="00:33.886" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">何故失うから楽になる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么 失去后才感到一阵轻松</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">'t te na ze u shi na u ka ra ra ku ni na ru</span></p><p begin="00:34.723" end="00:36.561" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">それでも少し<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也还有时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re de mo su ko shi</span></p><p begin="00:36.927" end="00:38.765" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">ムキになったって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会意气用事 但也没有关系</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ki ni na 't ta 't te ka ma wa na i n da</span></p><p begin="00:39.900" end="00:42.019" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">構わないんだ</p><p begin="00:43.216" end="00:46.006" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">ずっと痺れてるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我的心 已然麻痹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to shi bi re te ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:46.666" end="00:49.483" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">淡い光に欺かれる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被那依稀的光芒所蒙骗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a wa i hi ka ri ni a za mu ka re ru</span></p><p begin="00:49.967" end="00:52.839" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">風に抱かれ砂に溶け<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被清风拥抱 溶于砂石之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ze ni da ka re su na ni to ke</span></p><p begin="00:53.413" end="00:56.467" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">満たされるまでここに居よう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">留在这里吧 直到感到满足为止</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ta sa re ru ma de ko ko ni i yo u</span></p><p begin="00:56.728" end="00:59.888" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">きっと同じ意識を知る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你定知晓着同样的意识</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to o na ji i shi ki wo shi ru</span></p><p begin="01:00.065" end="01:03.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">奪ってみせて 愛の歌を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将那首情歌从我怀里夺走吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ba 't te mi se te a i no u ta wo</span></p><p begin="01:03.879" end="01:06.812" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">痛みに似た足りないもの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与痛楚相似 却又不足之物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ta mi ni ni ta ta ri na i mo no</span></p><p begin="01:07.017" end="01:10.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">波のように打ち寄せる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似海浪般在我脚边不断翻涌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na mi no yo u ni u chi yo se ru</span></p><p begin="01:12.821" end="01:16.305" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">底に留まる未晒しの想い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">藏存在心底 不曾袒露过的心意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ko ni to do ma ru mi za ra shi no o mo i</span></p><p begin="01:16.741" end="01:19.675" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">邪魔にならないのもやるせない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽说并不会妨碍到我 但仍会让我牵挂</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ja ma ni na ra na i no mo ya ru se na i</span></p><p begin="01:20.185" end="01:23.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">醒めてしまう前に終わらせよう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在苏醒前 结束这一切吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa me te shi ma u ma e ni o wa ra se yo u</span></p><p begin="01:23.532" end="01:26.367" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">収まりが良いのは頼もしい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">圆满的结局 更显可靠</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o sa ma ri ga i i no ha ta no mo shi i</span></p><p begin="01:26.700" end="01:27.468" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">そのあと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">自那之后 更感到满心眷恋</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no a to i to shi ku na 't ta 't te</span></p><p begin="01:28.099" end="01:30.444" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">愛しくなったって<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no a to i to shi ku na 't ta 't te</span></p><p begin="01:31.204" end="01:33.354" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">構わないんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也无妨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ma wa na i n da</span></p><p begin="01:34.638" end="01:37.438" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">ずっと痺れてるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我的心 已然麻痹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to shi bi re te ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:37.854" end="01:40.873" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">淡い光りに欺かれる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被那依稀的光芒所蒙骗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a wa i hi ka ri ni a za mu ka re ru</span></p><p begin="01:41.391" end="01:44.328" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">時が背中を追い越したら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当时间从被后赶超</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ki ga se na ka wo o i ko shi ta ra</span></p><p begin="01:44.856" end="01:47.935" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">夢はここにおいてくよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就将梦留存于此吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me ha ko ko ni o i te ku yo</span></p><p begin="01:48.178" end="01:51.211" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">きっと同じ意識を知る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你定知晓着同样的意识</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to o na ji i shi ki wo shi ru</span></p><p begin="01:51.604" end="01:54.703" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">奪ってみせて 哀の歌を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将那哀伤之歌从我怀里夺走吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ba 't te mi se te a i no u ta wo</span></p><p begin="01:55.154" end="01:57.955" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">救いに似た脆いもの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与救赎相似 却又脆弱之物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ku i ni ni ta mo ro i mo no</span></p><p begin="01:58.443" end="02:01.993" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">触れる度に傷めてしまう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每每触及于此 都会受尽伤痛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu re ru ta bi ni i ta me te shi ma u</span></p><p begin="02:02.914" end="02:09.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">記憶と繋がってる扉を叩いてみる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">敲响牵往回忆的门扉吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki o ku to tsu na ga 't te ru to bi ra wo ta ta i te mi ru</span></p><p begin="02:09.843" end="02:15.361" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">あとどれくらい信じられる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我究竟还能信你多久</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a to do re ku ra i shi n ji ra re ru</span></p><p begin="02:16.420" end="02:21.289" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">この先を進む理由でもあるんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心底也还有着要继续向前的理由</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no sa ki wo su su mu ri yu u de mo a ru n da</span></p><p begin="02:22.872" end="02:25.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">ずっと続いてくなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若要永恒延续</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to tsu zu i te ku na ra</span></p><p begin="02:29.571" end="02:32.855" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">いっそこのままでいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一如此时也无妨</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 's so ko no ma ma de i i</span></p><p begin="02:36.223" end="02:39.335" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">ずっと痺れてるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我的心 已然麻痹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">zu 't to shi bi re te ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:39.678" end="02:42.629" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">淡い光に欺かれる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被那依稀的光芒所蒙骗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a wa i hi ka ri ni a za mu ka re ru</span></p><p begin="02:42.784" end="02:46.149" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">風に抱かれ砂に溶け<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">被清风拥抱 溶于砂石之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ze ni da ka re su na ni to ke</span></p><p begin="02:46.376" end="02:49.492" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">満たされるまでここに居よう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">留在这里吧 直到感到满足为止</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi ta sa re ru ma de ko ko ni i yo u</span></p><p begin="02:49.740" end="02:52.943" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">きっと同じ意識を知る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你定知晓着同样的意识</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki 't to o na ji i shi ki wo shi ru</span></p><p begin="02:53.254" end="02:56.237" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">奪ってみせて 愛の歌を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将那首情歌从我怀里夺走吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ba 't te mi se te a i no u ta wo</span></p><p begin="02:56.930" end="02:59.777" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">痛みに似た足りないもの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与痛楚相似 却又不足之物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ta mi ni ni ta ta ri na i mo no</span></p><p begin="03:00.213" end="03:03.363" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">波のように打ち寄せる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似海浪般在我脚边不断翻涌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na mi no yo u ni u chi yo se ru</span></p><p begin="03:06.530" end="03:09.164" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">そう言えばそうこの胸の穴<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">话说回来 不曾留意过</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so u i e ba so u ko no mu ne no a na</span></p><p begin="03:09.825" end="03:12.674" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">気にも留めないでいたよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">内心的空洞呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki ni mo to me na i de i ta yo</span></p><p begin="03:13.248" end="03:16.002" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">新しい道になるんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这也成为了我崭新的前路</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta ra shi i mi chi ni na ru n da</span></p><p begin="03:16.567" end="03:20.404" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">今はうまく言えないけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然现在 我还无法确定如此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma ha u ma ku i e na i ke do</span></p></div></body></tt>